abstract: >-
  Elementary and proof-logged exclusions of fourteen prime-order automorphism
  cycle types marked pending, uncovered, or unfinished in public case lists
  and coverage ledgers audited through 2026-09-08 for hypothetical Ramsey
  (5,5,43) graphs.
